    "content": "# ==============================================================================\n# BLOGGER & GEMINI AUTOMATION ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION\n# ==============================================================================\n\n# 1. Google Gemini AI API Key (Obtain from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey)\nGEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here\n\n# 2. Google Blogger Blog ID (Numeric ID from your Blogger Dashboard URL)\n# Example URL: https://www.blogger.com/blog/posts/8492049182391029384 -> ID is 8492049182391029384\nBLOGGER_BLOG_ID=your_blogger_blog_id_here\n\n# 3. Path to OAuth2 Client Secrets JSON file from Google Cloud Console\n# (Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create Credentials -> OAuth 2.0 Client IDs -> Desktop App -> Download JSON)\n# IMPORTANT: Enter the filename (e.g. client_secrets.json). DO NOT enter your GOCSPX secret key string here!\nGOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRETS_FILE=client_secrets.json\n\n# 4. Path to persist OAuth tokens (auto-generated in same directory after first browser login)\nGOOGLE_TOKEN_FILE=token.json\n\n# 5. Geographies to monitor for Tech Trends (US = United States, GB = United Kingdom)\nGEO_REGIONS=US,GB\n\n# 6. Target batch post count per run (Default: 5 articles)\nPOSTS_PER_RUN=5\n\n# 7. Model choice (Supported: gemini-3.8-flash, gemini-flash-latest, gemini-3.1-flash-lite)\nGEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash\n\n# 8. POST PUBLISHING STATUS: 'DRAFT' or 'LIVE'\n# 'DRAFT' (Recommended): Safely stages posts in your Blogger dashboard for human review before publishing.\n# 'LIVE': Automatically publishes directly live to your readers immediately!\nBLOG_POST_STATUS=DRAFT\n\n# 9. IMAGES CONFIGURATION\n# INCLUDE_IMAGES: 'true' (add images to post) or 'false' (pure text & code, no image tags or suggestions)\nINCLUDE_IMAGES=true\n\n# IMAGE_MODE: 'direct' or 'suggestion'\n# 'direct': Embeds real, high-resolution AI tech illustration figure cards directly in Blogger HTML.\n# 'suggestion': Generates attractive designer callout cards with prompt recommendations for manual graphics review.\nIMAGE_MODE=direct\n\n# 10. AUTOMATIC INTERNAL BACKLINKING\n# 'true': Automatically fetches your already published Blogger posts and seamlessly weaves natural contextual backlinks into the new article!\nENABLE_INTERNAL_LINKING=true\n\n# Maximum number of natural internal backlinks to weave per article (Default: 2)\nMAX_INTERNAL_BACKLINKS=2\n\n# 11. ARTICLE MEMORY & DEDUPLICATION DATABASE FILE\n# Tracks every article ever written so duplicate topics are NEVER re-generated.\nHISTORY_FILE=published_history.json\n"
